Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.41,0:00:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)上吧 彼岸·希望乡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)无论到哪里都要把我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们的梦想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}击碎吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 七皇环绕！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冀望皇 巴利安被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其混沌超量单元一起除外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让伤害变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 竟然有这种卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 战斗结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组 将阶级3以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力份的伤害给予对方！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)从这里开始反击!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:00:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 彼岸之希望 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.51,0:01:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量素材除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地特殊召唤 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复攻击力一半的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑刺枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(鲨鱼)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有着 霍普和黑鳍枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想起来了 和你的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 一次又一次地碰撞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中我们一直聊到了现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵…从那时候起 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是个麻烦得要死的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是 死皮赖脸地钻进别人心里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自顾自地开始多管闲事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 你是我的伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.66,0:02:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 我们已经回不到从前那样了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是不可能的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我们 和那时候不一样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 已经没法互相理解了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你搞错了一件很重要的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们 早就已经互相理解了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的心情什么的我早就明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是以怎样的心情一路战斗过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，人就算彼此理解，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也有无法退让的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有相信我的同伴们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们现在也和我一起战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能背叛那些相信我的家伙们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能失去他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((打开门吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如此一来，你就能获得新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但作为代价，你将失去最重要的东西))
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我会失去的东西…》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是星光 还是鲨鱼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 不 我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个都不会失去！》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我用希望皇霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中杀手番茄的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这家伙除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效对方的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为鲨鱼与你们相遇这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:05:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会忘记。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在的我 已经不是鲨鱼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 巴利安的纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了引导巴利安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要 成为这场决斗的胜者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将努梅隆代码拿到手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡-！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法发动 超量宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地上的超量怪兽数量 进行抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我 抽卡２张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我 特殊召唤巨齿鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在发动了通常魔法的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且我 召唤骷髅海妖！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级３的巨齿鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骷髅海妖进行 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧潜航母舰 空气鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动空气鲨的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量素材取除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌是1张。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就真的结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)不要啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气龙卷！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 承受伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当玩家受到伤害时…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.55,0:07:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把伤害变成零…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡变成自己怪兽区的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 无效掉的伤害数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会下降！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 就用黑鳍枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不会让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动希望皇的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去除一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让攻击无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇就没有超量素材了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用空气鲨攻击希望皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡如果不是 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是伤害你得吃下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 你……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们的生命值竟然只剩50了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《鲨鱼 你的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一点都没有动摇吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真强啊 不管是那家伙还是快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是 让人笑出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强得让人笑出来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直以为能和大家一直在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能一直和那帮家伙做同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 可是啊 唯独这次…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独这次怎么也找不到答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到底在干什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易才打倒了千尊主。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却和我最好的同伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弄得遍体鳞伤地决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.77,0:10:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)不能放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己给自己定下极限一点都不像游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你身上承载着大家的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的希望啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.51,0:10:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以……所以你要坚持到最后啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被骂了呢，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得她越来越像明里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.23,0:10:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得没错，小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说得对。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，还没有找到任何答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与我一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）闪耀着希望的心与心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以真正羁绊相连的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这两个灵魂交汇之时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传承至今的奇迹之力将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽尔)异热同心变换
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 泽尔把你们的全力砸向我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！ 我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽尔)最强决斗者的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽卡 也是决斗者所创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银辉之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有希望皇霍普时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力 上升800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银辉变换 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 银辉霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 七皇升格。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有超量怪兽全部解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将我上个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用七皇升格除外的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧混沌超量 冀望皇巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是那只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将解放的怪兽数量加一{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把除外的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量单元复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3000！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 冀望皇巴利安的攻击力就是\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3000！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过用这个效果特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用混沌超量单元的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 但还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间西尔菲德之翼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方将怪兽超量特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1600点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普攻击冀望皇 巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(泽尔)霍普剑·西尔菲德斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 抽卡重置战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗时 双方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并使那只怪兽的攻击无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 这次攻击也！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！抽卡重置战斗的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不止这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将因这个效果抽到的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合如果不使用的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那名玩家就会败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这就是我们命运的抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定胜负的最后一抽。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们最后的抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人·混沌·抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这张卡是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们命运的卡？》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 赢的会是我们还是纳修呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都赌在这张卡上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻倍机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被无效的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让那只怪兽的攻击力变成两倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再战斗一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:14:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一次降临到我们身上的胜利机会。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要波普的攻击能通过……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我们就赢了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（将会失去最重要的东西））
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此那扇门所说的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么解除了异热同心？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体，会失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那扇门对我这么说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将失去的最重要的东西{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.17,0:15:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是我自己本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，再这样下去我就会不再是我自己了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.49,0:15:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我总有一天能互相理解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有敌人也没有同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能一起笑着决斗的日子会到来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直如此相信着战斗至今。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要在这场与鲨鱼的决斗中获胜{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了使用 No.卡片的奇迹之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就必须夺走那家伙的性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说 直到现在那家伙依然是重要的同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牺牲那个同伴换来的未来 真的可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的未来真的能成为我们的未来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都把希望{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄托在我身上这我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.73,0:16:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就明白了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你无论何时 都用相信他人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开辟了未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论那会变成怎样的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我都会永远与你同在。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，星光体……来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动银盾之翼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这张卡变成超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击冀望皇巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑·双重斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个瞬间，我发动霍普的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.27,0:17:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把霍普的攻击无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然无效自己的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你到底想干什么？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么这样那样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牺牲你的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，知道自己在说什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！我们的生命虽然只有50{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就算这样，我也会一直承受住你的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到找到新的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直一直，无论到哪里！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你们在这场决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到的答案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会后悔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让我做我自己伙伴们，我一个都不会抛弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的热血沸腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子的大笨蛋啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，我就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法「荣光七福」发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当混沌怪兽存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被除外的 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成混沌超量·单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 这只怪兽的攻击力变为7000！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个回合 冀望皇巴利安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会在战斗中被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害也无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.31,0:18:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后将本该由我承受的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？那么 如果双倍机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动攻击的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们就会承受伤害然后输掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这个回合的战斗就这样平局！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「荣耀七」在战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会将我的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成与对手生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变化的数值相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.35,0:19:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的生命值变化为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《真是的，你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:19:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会用「双重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升级机会」这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那种地方居然不攻过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是 老好人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.65,0:20:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 游马 星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的话 我记在心里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 你从一开始就……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少胡说！ 我可是认真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没什么好后悔的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…… 人在成长的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.39,0:20:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大多会丢掉重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你 绝对不要丢掉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:21:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信他人的力量 不放弃的心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不要丢掉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们所引领的未来我也很想看看{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但看来是不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！ 别让这个笨蛋离开视线。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你们 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一生中的挚友。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和你们进行最后一场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最棒的决斗，真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
